# Telegram Bot Configuration
ADMIN_ID=123456789
WHATSAPP_GROUP_LINK=https://chat.whatsapp.com/your-group-link

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. Replace ADMIN_ID with your actual Telegram user ID
# 3. Replace WHATSAPP_GROUP_LINK with your actual WhatsApp group link
# 4. The BOT_TOKEN is already set in the code (you may want to move it to environment variables for security)